(2000000000000000016,'LRU 页面置换','### 题目描述\n模拟操作系统的最近最久未使用（LRU）页面置换算法，统计缺页次数。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行物理块数 m（1 <= m <= 10）。\n第二行访问序列长度 n（1 <= n <= 1000）。\n第三行 n 个页面号。\n\n### 输出格式\n缺页次数。\n\n### 样例输入\n3\n12\n1 2 3 4 1 2 5 1 2 3 4 5\n\n### 样例输出\n8\n\n### 提示\n每次缺页时淘汰最长时间未被访问的页面；命中时把该页面移动到“最近使用”位置。','["操作系统","中等","页面置换"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int m = sc.nextInt(), n = sc.nextInt();\n    LinkedList<Integer> list = new LinkedList<>();\n    int faults = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n      int p = sc.nextInt();\n      if (list.contains(p)) {\n        list.remove((Integer) p);\n        list.addLast(p);\n      } else {\n        faults++;\n        if (list.size() == m) list.removeFirst();\n        list.addLast(p);\n      }\n    }\n    System.out.println(faults);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"3\\n12\\n1 2 3 4 1 2 5 1 2 3 4 5","output":"8"},{"input":"1\\n3\\n1 2 1","output":"2"},{"input":"4\\n6\\n1 2 3 4 5 6","output":"6"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000017,'快速幂取模','### 题目描述\n计算 a^b mod p 的值。\n\n### 输入格式\n一行三个整数 a b p（1 <= a <= 10^9，0 <= b <= 10^9，2 <= p <= 10^9）。\n\n### 输出格式\na^b mod p 的结果。\n\n### 样例输入\n2 10 1000\n\n### 样例输出\n24\n\n### 提示\n直接连乘会超时，使用快速幂（按 b 的二进制位拆分），每步都取模。','["算法","中等","数学"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    long x = sc.nextLong(), y = sc.nextLong(), p = sc.nextLong();\n    long base = ((x % p) + p) % p, ans = 1 % p;\n    while (y > 0) {\n      if ((y & 1) == 1) ans = ans * base % p;\n      base = base * base % p;\n      y >>= 1;\n    }\n    System.out.println(ans);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"2 10 1000","output":"24"},{"input":"3 0 7","output":"1"},{"input":"7 13 100","output":"7"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),


(2000000000000000018,'最大公约数与最小公倍数','### 题目描述\n给定两个正整数，输出它们的最大公约数（GCD）和最小公倍数（LCM）。\n\n### 输入格式\n一行两个正整数 a b（1 <= a,b <= 10^9）。\n\n### 输出格式\n两个整数：最大公约数和最小公倍数，空格分隔。\n\n### 样例输入\n6 8\n\n### 样例输出\n2 24','["算法","简单","数学"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  static long gcd(long a, long b) { return b == 0 ? a : gcd(b, a % b); }\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    long a = sc.nextLong(), b = sc.nextLong();\n    long g = gcd(a, b);\n    System.out.println(g + " " + (a / g * b));\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"6 8","output":"2 24"},{"input":"7 13","output":"1 91"},{"input":"12 18","output":"6 36"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000019,'合并区间计数','### 题目描述\n给定 n 个闭区间，将重叠或相接（端点相等）的区间合并，输出合并后的区间个数。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行整数 n（1 <= n <= 100000）。\n接下来 n 行，每行两个整数 l r（l <= r）。\n\n### 输出格式\n合并后的区间个数。\n\n### 样例输入\n3\n1 3\n2 6\n8 10\n\n### 样例输出\n2','["算法","中等","排序"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int n = sc.nextInt();\n    long[][] a = new long[n][2];\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { a[i][0] = sc.nextLong(); a[i][1] = sc.nextLong(); }\n    Arrays.sort(a, (x, y) -> Long.compare(x[0], y[0]));\n    int cnt = 0;\n    long r = Long.MIN_VALUE;\n    for (long[] seg : a) {\n      if (seg[0] > r) { cnt++; r = seg[1]; }\n      else r = Math.max(r, seg[1]);\n    }\n    System.out.println(cnt);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"3\\n1 3\\n2 6\\n8 10","output":"2"},{"input":"2\\n1 4\\n4 5","output":"1"},{"input":"1\\n0 0","output":"1"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000020,'最长递增子序列','### 题目描述\n给定一个整数序列，求最长严格递增子序列（LIS）的长度。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行整数 n（1 <= n <= 3000）。\n第二行 n 个整数。\n\n### 输出格式\n最长递增子序列的长度。\n\n### 样例输入\n8\n10 9 2 5 3 7 101 18\n\n### 样例输出\n4\n\n### 提示\nO(n^2) 动态规划即可通过；也可以尝试 O(n log n) 的贪心 + 二分。','["算法","困难","动态规划"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int n = sc.nextInt();\n    int[] a = new int[n], dp = new int[n];\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) a[i] = sc.nextInt();\n    int best = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n      dp[i] = 1;\n      for (int j = 0; j < i; j++) if (a[j] < a[i]) dp[i] = Math.max(dp[i], dp[j] + 1);\n      best = Math.max(best, dp[i]);\n    }\n    System.out.println(best);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"8\\n10 9 2 5 3 7 101 18","output":"4"},{"input":"5\\n5 4 3 2 1","output":"1"},{"input":"6\\n1 2 3 4 5 6","output":"6"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000021,'有向图判环','### 题目描述\n给定一个有向图，判断其中是否存在环（对应 408 中拓扑排序的应用）。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行两个整数 n m（1 <= n <= 1000，0 <= m <= 5000），表示顶点数和边数。\n接下来 m 行，每行两个整数 a b，表示一条从 a 到 b 的有向边。\n\n### 输出格式\n存在环输出 YES，否则输出 NO。\n\n### 样例输入\n3 3\n1 2\n2 3\n3 1\n\n### 样例输出\nYES\n\n### 提示\n拓扑排序思想：不断删去入度为 0 的点，若最后还剩点则存在环。','["数据结构","中等","图"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int n = sc.nextInt(), m = sc.nextInt();\n    List<List<Integer>> g = new ArrayList<>();\n    for (int i = 0; i <= n; i++) g.add(new ArrayList<>());\n    int[] indeg = new int[n + 1];\n    for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n      int a = sc.nextInt(), b = sc.nextInt();\n      g.get(a).add(b);\n      indeg[b]++;\n    }\n    Deque<Integer> q = new ArrayDeque<>();\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) if (indeg[i] == 0) q.add(i);\n    int removed = 0;\n    while (!q.isEmpty()) {\n      int u = q.poll();\n      removed++;\n      for (int v : g.get(u)) if (--indeg[v] == 0) q.add(v);\n    }\n    System.out.println(removed < n ? "YES" : "NO");\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"3 3\\n1 2\\n2 3\\n3 1","output":"YES"},{"input":"3 2\\n1 2\\n2 3","output":"NO"},{"input":"4 0","output":"NO"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000022,'最小生成树边权和','### 题目描述\n给定一个带权无向连通图，用 Kruskal 算法求最小生成树的边权之和。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行两个整数 n m（1 <= n <= 1000，n-1 <= m <= 5000）。\n接下来 m 行，每行三个整数 a b w，表示顶点 a、b 之间有一条权值为 w 的边。\n\n### 输出格式\n最小生成树的边权之和。\n\n### 样例输入\n4 5\n1 2 1\n2 3 2\n3 4 3\n4 1 4\n1 3 5\n\n### 样例输出\n6','["数据结构","困难","图"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  static int[] fa;\n  static int find(int x) { return fa[x] == x ? x : (fa[x] = find(fa[x])); }\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int n = sc.nextInt(), m = sc.nextInt();\n    int[][] e = new int[m][3];\n    for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) { e[i][0] = sc.nextInt(); e[i][1] = sc.nextInt(); e[i][2] = sc.nextInt(); }\n    Arrays.sort(e, (x, y) -> x[2] - y[2]);\n    fa = new int[n + 1];\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) fa[i] = i;\n    long sum = 0;\n    int used = 0;\n    for (int[] ed : e) {\n      int ra = find(ed[0]), rb = find(ed[1]);\n      if (ra != rb) { fa[ra] = rb; sum += ed[2]; if (++used == n - 1) break; }\n    }\n    System.out.println(sum);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"4 5\\n1 2 1\\n2 3 2\\n3 4 3\\n4 1 4\\n1 3 5","output":"6"},{"input":"3 3\\n1 2 5\\n2 3 5\\n1 3 1","output":"6"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000023,'汉诺塔移动次数','### 题目描述\n汉诺塔问题：把 n 个圆盘从 A 柱借助 B 柱移动到 C 柱，每次只能移动一个圆盘且大盘不能压小盘，输出最少移动次数。\n\n### 输入格式\n一个整数 n（1 <= n <= 30）。\n\n### 输出格式\n最少移动次数。\n\n### 样例输入\n3\n\n### 样例输出\n7\n\n### 提示\n递推式 H(n) = 2 * H(n-1) + 1，即 2^n - 1。','["算法","简单","递归"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int n = sc.nextInt();\n    System.out.println((1L << n) - 1);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"3","output":"7"},{"input":"1","output":"1"},{"input":"10","output":"1023"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000024,'子网可用主机数','### 题目描述\n给定一个 CIDR 前缀长度 x（如 /24），计算该 IPv4 子网中可分配给主机的地址数量（去掉网络地址与广播地址）。\n\n### 输入格式\n一个整数 x（1 <= x <= 30）。\n\n### 输出格式\n可用主机数。\n\n### 样例输入\n24\n\n### 样例输出\n254\n\n### 提示\n主机位有 32-x 位，可用主机数为 2^(32-x) - 2。','["计算机网络","简单","计算"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int x = sc.nextInt();\n    System.out.println((1L << (32 - x)) - 2);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"24","output":"254"},{"input":"30","output":"2"},{"input":"16","output":"65534"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000025,'逆波兰表达式求值','### 题目描述\n给定一个逆波兰（后缀）表达式，求其值。运算符只有 + - * /，除法向零取整，中间结果均在 int 范围内。\n\n### 输入格式\n一行，若干 token 用空格分隔，每个 token 是整数或运算符。\n\n### 输出格式\n表达式的值。\n\n### 样例输入\n2 1 + 3 *\n\n### 样例输出\n9\n\n### 提示\n用栈：遇数入栈，遇运算符弹出两个数计算后压回。','["数据结构","中等","栈"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    String line = sc.nextLine().trim();\n    Deque<Integer> st = new ArrayDeque<>();\n    for (String t : line.split("\\s+")) {\n      if (t.equals("+") || t.equals("-") || t.equals("*") || t.equals("/")) {\n        int b = st.pop(), a = st.pop();\n        switch (t) {\n          case "+": st.push(a + b); break;\n          case "-": st.push(a - b); break;\n          case "*": st.push(a * b); break;\n          default: st.push(a / b);\n        }\n      } else st.push(Integer.parseInt(t));\n    }\n    System.out.println(st.pop());\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"2 1 + 3 *","output":"9"},{"input":"4 13 5 / +","output":"6"},{"input":"3 4 + 5 *","output":"35"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000026,'8 位补码表示','### 题目描述\n给定一个十进制整数 x，输出它的 8 位二进制补码表示（对应计算机组成原理中的机器数表示）。\n\n### 输入格式\n一个整数 x（-128 <= x <= 127）。\n\n### 输出格式\n8 位二进制字符串。\n\n### 样例输入\n-5\n\n### 样例输出\n11111011\n\n### 提示\n负数补码 = 对应正数按位取反再加 1。','["计算机组成原理","中等","进制"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int x = sc.nextInt() & 0xFF;\n    StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();\n    for (int i = 7; i >= 0; i--) sb.append((x >> i) & 1);\n    System.out.println(sb);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"-5","output":"11111011"},{"input":"5","output":"00000101"},{"input":"-128","output":"10000000"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000027,'FCFS 磁盘调度','### 题目描述\n模拟先来先服务（FCFS）磁盘调度算法：磁头从初始位置出发，按请求顺序依次服务，输出磁头移动的总磁道数（寻道长度）。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行初始磁道号 s（0 <= s <= 1000）。\n第二行请求数 n（1 <= n <= 1000）。\n第三行 n 个磁道号。\n\n### 输出格式\n总寻道长度。\n\n### 样例输入\n100\n5\n55 58 39 18 90\n\n### 样例输出\n160','["操作系统","简单","模拟"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    long cur = sc.nextLong(), sum = 0;\n    int n = sc.nextInt();\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n      long t = sc.nextLong();\n      sum += Math.abs(t - cur);\n      cur = t;\n    }\n    System.out.println(sum);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"100\\n5\\n55 58 39 18 90","output":"160"},{"input":"50\\n3\\n50 50 50","output":"0"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0);
